## 🎯 Overview

This project implements a robust customer churn prediction system that helps businesses identify customers who are likely to discontinue their services. Using historical customer data, the system employs advanced machine learning techniques to predict churn with high accuracy, enabling proactive retention strategies.

### Business Impact

- **Revenue Protection**: Identify at-risk customers before they churn
- **Cost Reduction**: Targeted retention efforts instead of broad campaigns
- **Customer Insights**: Understand key drivers of churn
- **Resource Optimization**: Focus retention efforts on high-risk customers

