## 📊 Dataset

### Source
The dataset is the **IBM Telco Customer Churn Dataset**, available from:
- [Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/muhammadshahidazeem/customer-churn-dataset)
- [IBM GitHub](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/IBM/telco-customer-churn-on-icp4d/master/data/Telco-Customer-Churn.csv)

### Dataset Statistics
- **Total Samples**: 7,043 customers
- **Features**: 20 attributes
- **Target**: Churn (Yes/No)
- **Churn Rate**: 26.54%
- **Missing Values**: None

### Features Description

| Category | Features | Description |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| **Demographics** | gender, SeniorCitizen, Partner, Dependents | Customer personal information |
| **Services** | PhoneService, MultipleLines, InternetService, OnlineSecurity, OnlineBackup, DeviceProtection, TechSupport, StreamingTV, StreamingMovies | Subscribed services |
| **Account** | tenure, Contract, PaperlessBilling, PaymentMethod | Account information |
| **Charges** | MonthlyCharges, TotalCharges | Billing amounts |
| **Target** | Churn | Whether customer left (Yes/No) |

